Ambient option projection proof, not PDK temperature qualification
model voltage vsource
Vambient (Ambient 0) voltage dc=$temp
Vnominal (Nominal 0) voltage dc=$tnom
Vsweep (Swept 0) voltage dc=0
control
options rawfile="ascii" tnom=25 temp=27
analysis first op
clear options
options rawfile="ascii" tnom=25 temp=80
sweep bias instance="Vsweep" parameter="dc" from=0 to=1 step=1
  analysis second op
endc
